<title>USA: DAKA Int'l sees Q1 loss of $0.35-$0.40.</title>
<headline>DAKA Int'l sees Q1 loss of $0.35-$0.40.</headline>
<dateline>DANVERS, Mass. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>DAKA International Inc said Wednesday it expected to post a net loss of between $0.35 and $0.40 per share for its first quarter ended September 28.</p>
<p>The company said its Fuddruckers Inc restaurant chain was continuing to hold back earnings, though it was taking steps to improve the unit's performance. It said it expected the chain to return to profit in the second quarter and for the rest of the year.</p>
</text>
